    "about.title": "About",
    "about.kicker": "VSNT // Synthetic Presence Systems",
    "about.product": "Holophone™ · Adaptive Persona Interface",
    "about.lead": "A synthetic-presence architecture designed to maintain a persistent, contextual and multimodal persona — combining identity, memory, temporal continuity, internal state, initiative, voice, media and a shared environment.",
    "about.core": "Core systems",
    "about.persona": "Identity, personality, behaviour, mood and presence are maintained as a coherent state instead of being reconstructed for every message.",
    "about.memory": "Persistent memories, conversational context, tastes, events and anti-repetition safeguards provide continuity beyond a single session.",
    "about.temporal": "Holophone tracks elapsed time, life rhythms, activities and state changes so that hours — or days — of absence retain meaning.",
    "about.interaction": "Text, voice, images, music, Braindance, Refuge and structured interactions are coordinated around the same persona.",
    "about.initiative": "The persona can take initiative according to context, activity and internal state — or decide there is no relevant reason to intervene.",
    "about.privacy": "Local storage, application locking, Android preview protection, controlled backups and service secrets configured locally by the user.",
    "about.dataTitle": "Data architecture",
    "about.packageTitle": "Persona packages",
    "about.companyTitle": "VSim NeuroTek",
    "about.init": "Runtime initialization…",
    "about.badgePersona": "Persistent Persona",
    "about.badgeTemporal": "Temporal Continuity",
    "about.badgeLocal": "Local-First",
    "about.badgeMulti": "Multimodal Runtime",
    "about.data": "<strong>Local-first.</strong> Holophone persistent data resides on the device. When a feature uses an external service, only the information required for that feature is transmitted to the relevant provider. Service keys are not embedded in the distributed application: they are supplied and stored locally by the user.",
    "about.package": "An imported persona may contain behavioural instructions intended for the AI runtime. Holophone presents this information before validation so the user remains in control of what is installed.",
    "about.company": "<strong>Holophone™</strong> is presented as a VSim NeuroTek (VSNT) technology from the Synthetic Presence Systems division. <i>Connecting Minds &amp; Bytes.</i>",
    "about.legal": "PERSONAL RUNTIME · NO EMBEDDED SERVICE KEYS · USER-CONTROLLED DATA<br>HOLOPHONE™ / VSIM NEUROTEK (VSNT)"
  },
  "legacyText": {
    "Premier démarrage": "First launch",
    "Une seule personne. Tu écris son passé, son caractère, sa façon de parler — elle improvise le reste, se souvient, change d'humeur, et t'écrit parfois d'elle-même.": "One person. You define their past, personality and way of speaking — they improvise the rest, remember, change mood and sometimes write to you on their own.",
    "1 · Il te faut une clé": "1 · You need an API key",
    "L'application ne contient aucune intelligence artificielle : elle interroge celle que tu choisis. Clé gratuite chez Google AI Studio, sans carte bancaire.": "The app does not embed an AI model: it connects to the provider you choose. A free key is available from Google AI Studio without a credit card.",
    "Ta clé reste sur cet appareil et n'est envoyée qu'au fournisseur choisi. Aucun compte, aucun serveur.": "Your key stays on this device and is sent only to the selected provider. No Holophone account or server.",
